---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { href } from "../lib/paths";
---
<Layout title="For Students | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">For students</div><h1>Healthcare independence, with a doctor right in town.</h1><p class="lead">A local pediatrician in Blacksburg. Proactive check-ins around midterms and holidays, and a care plan you help build.</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="grid"><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg><h3>Your care plan stays active</h3><p>Prescriptions and treatment plans don't lapse when you get to campus. We keep everything running smoothly while helping you manage it yourself.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg><h3>A doctor right down the road</h3><p>Just eight minutes from campus, with scheduled touchpoints before finals, after holidays, and whenever your routine shifts.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-leaf"/></svg><h3>Navigating health as an adult</h3><p>From sleep hygiene and stress management to managing asthma or chronic needs—learn how to handle your health while you have dedicated support right in your corner.</p></div><div class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg><h3>Your privacy, your choice</h3><p>At 18, your medical chart belongs to you. If you want a clear agreement on when we update your parents, we establish it together and stick to it.</p></div></div></div>
<section><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">When students write us</div><h2>When you need us.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Same-day care</h3><p>Same-day availability in Blacksburg with a doctor who already knows your medical baseline.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Prescription refills</h3><p>Keeping your existing regimen active and managed seamlessly all semester long.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Strategic check-ins</h3><p>Brief, supportive touchpoints timed around high-stress academic windows.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>University &amp; housing forms</h3><p>Help with athletic clearances, housing accommodations, or travel health requirements.</p></div></div>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
